Date: Wed, 27 Aug 2025 13:18:36 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 483/540] style:fix the warning in DTS

Changelogs:
1. fix the warning in DTS
arch/riscv/boot/dts/eswin/eic7702-deepcomputing-fml13v03-evt.dts:1100.17-1116.4: Warning (spi_bus_bridge): /soc/spi@50814000/spi@0: incorrect #address-cells for SPI bus
  also defined at arch/riscv/boot/dts/eswin/eic7702-deepcomputing-fml13v03-evt.dts:1639.10-1649.3
