arch/riscv/boot/dts/eswin/eic7702-deepcomputing-fml13v03-evt.dtb: Warning (spi_bus_reg): Failed prerequisite 'spi_bus_bridge'

Signed-off-by: wangguosheng <wangguosheng@eswincomputing.com>
---
 .../riscv/boot/dts/eswin/eic7702-deepcomputing-fml13v03-evt.dts | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/riscv/boot/dts/eswin/eic7702-deepcomputing-fml13v03-evt.dts b/arch/riscv/boot/dts/eswin/eic7702-deepcomputing-fml13v03-evt.dts
